WEBVTT

00:11:28.785 --> 00:11:33.763
in mammals, amphibians,
reptiles, fish and birds.

00:11:33.763 --> 00:11:38.447
So I don't blame the vets
for feeling annoyed

00:11:38.447 --> 00:11:44.412
by my profession's
condescension and ignorance.

00:11:44.412 --> 00:11:47.152
But here's one from the vets:

00:11:47.152 --> 00:11:50.559
What do you call a veterinarian

00:11:50.559 --> 00:11:56.416
who can only take 
care of one species?

00:11:56.416 --> 00:11:59.737
A physician. (Laughter)

00:11:59.737 --> 00:12:05.946
Closing the gap has become 
a passion for me,